    "detailed_description": "Build your own space empire in this epic 4X strategy game!<br><br>Take control of a fleet of space ships and colonize the asteroid belt: a vast expanse of uncharted space. <br>Explore the frontier, expand your infrastructure, and navigate diplomatic relations with your homeland, neutral factions, and opponents<br><br>Expand without stop and achieve a technological marvel that will change the course of human history by constructing the first galactic stargate!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore a vast and rich new frontier</h2><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955200/extras/076e7bec375a76a9b307e512f324bb01.poster.avif?t=1732754460\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955200/extras/076e7bec375a76a9b307e512f324bb01.webm?t=1732754460\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955200/extras/076e7bec375a76a9b307e512f324bb01.mp4?t=1732754460\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Encounter our civilization greatest mysteries</h2><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955200/extras/88e34f5a9a9aecf93a1d3ff02501340d.poster.avif?t=1732754460\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955200/extras/88e34f5a9a9aecf93a1d3ff02501340d.webm?t=1732754460\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955200/extras/88e34f5a9a9aecf93a1d3ff02501340d.mp4?t=1732754460\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Expand your infrastructure</h2><br>Build space stations, mine asteroids, hire citizen from your homeland, exploit natural resources and thrive!<br><br><di