ted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955200/extras/2aaf732b093924f003ec214cb8e303bc.poster.avif?t=1732754460\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955200/extras/2aaf732b093924f003ec214cb8e303bc.webm?t=1732754460\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955200/extras/2aaf732b093924f003ec214cb8e303bc.mp4?t=1732754460\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Reach for the stars</h2><br>Be the first to build a massive and expensive Galactic Stargate connecting our solar system to Alpha Centauri.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">And much more!</h2><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955200/extras/cfa0d9cc885caf3ef15383106beb813d.poster.avif?t=1732754460\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955200/extras/cfa0d9cc885caf3ef15383106beb813d.webm?t=1732754460\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955200/extras/cfa0d9cc885caf3ef15383106beb813d.mp4?t=1732754460\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Lobby a vast array of sponsors that provide massive bonuses<br></li><li>Declare Independence from your home land*<br></li><li>Declare war with other AI players, invade and capture their station<br></li><li>Trade with neutral stations<br></li><li>Level up your citizen with hard work<br></li><li>Automate trade route between your space stations<br></li><li>Play with a friend in the experimental hotseat multiplayer for two</li></ul><br>* <i>not available in alpha yet</i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore a large amount of content</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>21 products, each with its production chain and fluctuating market price<br></li><li>84 buildings for your space stations<br></li><li>51 professions for your citizen<br></li><li>27 type of spaceships<br></li><li>73 sponsors<br></li><li>21 anomalies to explore<br></li><li>4 starting investor changing the way you will play the game</li></ul>",
